    {
      "id": "story_12765_p0_c0",
      "chunk_index": 0,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 0,
      "text": "Я до́ктор и то́нко за́нят на рабо́те.",
      "text_en": "I am a doctor and very busy at work.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Ya\" data-defn=\"я\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">Я</span><rt>Ya</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dóktor\" data-defn=\"доктор\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">до́ктор</span><rt>dóktor</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"i\" data-defn=\"и\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">и</span><rt>i</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tónko\" data-defn=\"тонко\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">то́нко</span><rt>tónko</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zányat\" data-defn=\"занят\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">за́нят</span><rt>zányat</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"na\" data-defn=\"на\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">на</span><rt>na</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"rabóte\" data-defn=\"работе\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">рабо́те</span><rt>rabóte</rt></ruby>.",
      "transliteration": "Ya dóktor i tónko zányat na rabóte.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.17,
      "duration": 2.17
    },
    {
      "id": "story_12765_p0_c1",
      "chunk_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "text": "Я не зна́ю, как ку́шать, и обы́чно не ем до́ма.",
      "text_en": "I don't know how to cook, and I usually don't eat at home.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Ya\" data-defn=\"я\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">Я</span><rt>Ya</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ne\" data-defn=\"не\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">не</span><rt>ne</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"znáyu\" data-defn=\"знаю\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">зна́ю</span><rt>znáyu</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"kak\" data-defn=\"как\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">как</span><rt>kak</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"kúshat&#x27;\" data-defn=\"кушать\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">ку́шать</span><rt>kúshat&#x27;</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"i\" data-defn=\"и\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">и</span><rt>i</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"obýchno\" data-defn=\"обычно\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">обы́чно</span><rt>obýchno</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ne\" data-defn=\"не\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">не</span><rt>ne</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"em\" data-defn=\"ем\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">ем</span><rt>em</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dóma\" data-defn=\"дома\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">до́ма</span><rt>dóma</rt></ruby>.",
      "transliteration": "Ya ne znáyu, kak kúshat', i obýchno ne em dóma.",
      "start": 2.52,
      "end": 5.58,
      "duration": 3.06
    },
    {
      "id": "story_12765_p0_c2",
      "chunk_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "text": "По́сле того́ как я оканчива́ю рабо́ту, я ча́сто иду́ в рестора́н о́коло больни́цы, чтобы поесть.",
      "text_en": "After get off work, I often go to the restaurant next to the hospital to eat.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Pósle\" data-defn=\"после\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">По́сле</span><rt>Pósle</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"togó\" data-defn=\"того\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">того́</span><rt>togó</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"kak\" data-defn=\"как\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">как</span><rt>kak</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ya\" data-defn=\"я\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">я</span><rt>ya</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"okanchiváyu\" data-defn=\"оканчиваю\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">оканчива́ю</span><rt>okanchiváyu</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"rabótu\" data-defn=\"работу\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">рабо́ту</span><rt>rabótu</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ya\" data-defn=\"я\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">я</span><rt>ya</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"chásto\" data-defn=\"часто\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">ча́сто</span><rt>chásto</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"idú\" data-defn=\"иду\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">иду́</span><rt>idú</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"v\" data-defn=\"в\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">в</span><rt>v</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"restorán\" data-defn=\"ресторан\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">рестора́н</span><rt>restorán</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ókolo\" data-defn=\"около\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">о́коло</span><rt>ókolo</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bol&#x27;nítsy\" data-defn=\"больницы\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">больни́цы</span><rt>bol&#x27;nítsy</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"chtoby\" data-defn=\"чтобы\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">чтобы</span><rt>chtoby</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"poest&#x27;\" data-defn=\"поесть\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">поесть</span><rt>poest&#x27;</rt></ruby>.",
      "transliteration": "Pósle togó kak ya okanchiváyu rabótu, ya chásto idú v restorán ókolo bol'nítsy, chtoby poest'.",
      "start": 5.93,
      "end": 10.93,
      "duration": 5.0
    },
    {
      "id": "story_12765_p0_c3",
      "chunk_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "text": "По́зже мои́ колле́ги сказа́ли мне, что я мо́гу заказа́ть еду на вы́нос с помо́щью моби́льного телефо́на, что было удо́бно и недорого́.",
      "text_en": "Later, my colleagues told me that I could order takeout using my mobile phone, which was convenient and cheap.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Pózzhe\" data-defn=\"позже\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">По́зже</span><rt>Pózzhe</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"moí\" data-defn=\"мои\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">мои́</span><rt>moí</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"kollégi\" data-defn=\"коллеги\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">колле́ги</span><rt>kollégi</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"skazáli\" data-defn=\"сказали\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">сказа́ли</span><rt>skazáli</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"mne\" data-defn=\"мне\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">мне</span><rt>mne</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"chto\" data-defn=\"что\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">что</span><rt>chto</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ya\" data-defn=\"я\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">я</span><rt>ya</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"mógu\" data-defn=\"могу\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">мо́гу</span><rt>mógu</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zakazát&#x27;\" data-defn=\"заказать\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">заказа́ть</span><rt>zakazát&#x27;</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"edu\" data-defn=\"еду\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">еду</span><rt>edu</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"na\" data-defn=\"на\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">на</span><rt>na</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"výnos\" data-defn=\"вынос\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">вы́нос</span><rt>výnos</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"s\" data-defn=\"с\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">с</span><rt>s</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"pomóshch&#x27;yu\" data-defn=\"помощью\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">помо́щью</span><rt>pomóshch&#x27;yu</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"mobíl&#x27;nogo\" data-defn=\"мобильного\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">моби́льного</span><rt>mobíl&#x27;nogo</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"telefóna\" data-defn=\"телефона\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">телефо́на</span><rt>telefóna</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"chto\" data-defn=\"что\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">что</span><rt>chto</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bylo\" data-defn=\"было\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">было</span><rt>bylo</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"udóbno\" data-defn=\"удобно\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">удо́бно</span><rt>udóbno</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"i\" data-defn=\"и\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">и</span><rt>i</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nedorogó\" data-defn=\"недорого\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">недорого́</span><rt>nedorogó</rt></ruby>.",
      "transliteration": "Pózzhe moí kollégi skazáli mne, chto ya mógu zakazát' edu na výnos s pomóshch'yu mobíl'nogo telefóna, chto bylo udóbno i nedorogó.",
      "start": 11.28,
      "end": 17.61,
